## Architecture

This generated workspace currently includes:

{% if "backend" in platforms %}- **backend/** - Spring Boot 4 (Kotlin) REST API -> Azure Container Apps
{% endif %}{% if "web-user-app" in platforms %}- **web-user-app/** - Next.js user-facing web app (TypeScript) -> Cloudflare via OpenNext
{% endif %}{% if "web-admin-portal" in platforms %}- **web-admin-portal/** - Next.js admin web portal (TypeScript) -> Cloudflare via OpenNext
{% endif %}{% if "mobile-android" in platforms %}- **mobile-android/** - Android app (Kotlin/Jetpack Compose, MVVM)
{% endif %}{% if "mobile-ios" in platforms %}- **mobile-ios/** - iOS app (Swift/SwiftUI, MVVM)
{% endif %}- **shared/** - OpenAPI contract and shared design tokens
- **knowledge/** - Product wiki and delivery workflow metadata
- **docs/** - Human-readable architecture and operations docs
{% if "backend" in platforms %}- **infra/** - Azure deployment scripts
{% endif %}

## First-Time Setup

This project includes a living product wiki at `knowledge/wiki/`. Before building
the first feature, initialize the wiki and advisory board:

- **Claude Code:** `/setup-project`
- **Codex:** `$setup-project`
- **Cursor:** ask the agent to "run setup-project"

This setup step interviews the team about domain risks, creates
`knowledge/wiki/advisory/BOARD.md`, and prepares the wiki for feature intake.

## Quick Start

```bash
# Review local configuration
{% if "backend" in platforms %}# Backend and local infrastructure defaults are already generated in `.env`
{% endif %}{% if "mobile-android" in platforms %}# Android API config is already generated in `mobile-android/local.config.properties`
{% endif %}{% if "mobile-ios" in platforms %}# iOS API config is already generated in `mobile-ios/Config/Debug.xcconfig`
# Update `mobile-ios/Config/Release.xcconfig` before production or TestFlight builds
{% endif %}{% if "web-user-app" in platforms %}cp web-user-app/.env.example web-user-app/.env.local
{% endif %}{% if "web-admin-portal" in platforms %}cp web-admin-portal/.env.example web-admin-portal/.env.local
{% endif %}# Edit the local config files as needed for your machine and credentials

{% if use_docker and "backend" in platforms %}# Start the local database first
docker compose up -d db

{% endif %}{% if "backend" in platforms %}# Start the backend locally
# task backend:run sets SPRING_PROFILES_ACTIVE=local
task backend:run

# If you are running from IntelliJ IDEA, use the `local` profile
# and keep real OAuth credentials in local overrides or IDE env vars

{% endif %}{% if "web-user-app" in platforms %}# Start the user web app
task web-user-app:dev

{% endif %}{% if "web-admin-portal" in platforms %}# Start the admin web portal
task web-admin-portal:dev

{% endif %}# Generate clients after any OpenAPI contract change
# npm install -g @openapitools/openapi-generator-cli
task generate-clients
```

